WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.533
Thirds and other fractions

2
00:00:04.733 --> 00:00:10.967
Mother shares one injera equally among three children. How much does each child get?

3
00:00:10.967 --> 00:00:14.667
She divided the injera into three equal parts.

4
00:00:14.667 --> 00:00:19.833
Each part is one third; we write it like this: one over three.

5
00:00:19.833 --> 00:00:23.100
Two parts are two thirds.

6
00:00:23.100 --> 00:00:27.267
Three thirds make one whole injera.
